text:
President Trump’s responses to the Covid-19 pandemic have been dizzying, and at times, demonstrably untrue. It’s no wonder
most Americans
don’t trust what he is saying about the coronavirus. In the above video, we compared Trump’s words to those of the public health officials leading his administration’s response. In a life or death crisis, the consequences of bending the truth have never been clearer.
